business_count":3},{"category":"Cafes","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"B4zE07aML4DoLFd8gMVMPQ","review_id":"Zg-zAnLLzzuxNZ_GAO8UzQ","date":"2019-12-06T15:38:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398599863052368,"text_excerpt":"A great funky little coffee shop right on the Lafitte Greenway. Perfect place to stop while on bike or foot. I have been here often and have worked here. They have WiFi and outlets. The drinks are quality and they have a fizz bar (Sodajerks) that is awesome!! I love a good bubbly drink and these do not disappoint. This is very much a community feel here with everyone saying hello. Hey Coffee Co. hosts many events like latte art competitions and one event I saw recently was a Holiday Market. If you go here you'll be greeted warmly and will want to come back! It truly is unique and a treasure in the neigjborhood"},{"business_id":"B4zE07aML4DoLFd8gMVMPQ","review_id":"-e0K7mpd8phG4wGkluaaAQ","date":"2021-01-18T17:28:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9377864599227905,"text_excerpt":"HEY Coffee Co. is amazing. I love this location because it's right on the Greenway. So fun to stop for an iced coffee on my way down to the Quarter. My favorite is their cold brew with a splash of cream. It's delicious!!! COVID Stuff: The inside is very small and is currently closed due to COVID, so they are only doing walk up service. They have tables outside and in the grass. It's really cute, actually. Gotta have a mask! Really though, I love this coffee co and everything they stand for. They lost their shop uptown this year so drop on by and support them on the Greenway :)"},{"business_id":"B4zE07aML4DoLFd8gMVMPQ","review_id":"OhUA09H45QtgKFIrLAIpcw","date":"2019-02-28T23:11:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9241105318069458,"text_excerpt":"Yay! So happy to see Hey! Cafe expand. The new location is great. Baristas are super friendly and coffee is awesome. They've got good snacks too. Kinda small as far as seating goes, but we got a table no problem"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
